% the robustness of the proposed method where a smooth initial guess for the
% nonlinear equation is given by solving a Laplace's equation. Numerical
% benchmarks in both two dimensions and three dimensions confirm the optimal
% convergence rates under several different error measures including an
% interface error measure, showing that our method is accurate and robust. A
% three-dimensional genus 2 surface is adopted to demonstrate the capability of
% the method for the reinitialization of complicated geometries.
